# Environment template — Daily Ledger (static frontend)
# -------------------------------------------------------
# This app is 100% static: no backend, no build step, no secrets.
# There are NO required variables for any platform.
#
# If you deploy the Docker image on a container platform that injects
# PORT (Railway, Render, Fly.io), the container already listens on 8080
# and the platform maps it automatically — no config needed.
#
# OPTIONAL (container platforms only):
# PORT=8080   # must match the nginx listen port in deployment/nginx.conf
